<div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #222; max-width: 640px;">
    <p>Dear {{data.recipientName}} (Accounts team),</p>

    <p>
        Please use the pre-filled forms attached below to prepare the following FDR.<br>
        The purpose of the FDR is {{data.purpose}}.{{#if data.isBgPurpose}} (BG in case of FDR for BG){{/if}}
    </p>

    <p>Please prepare the BG using the details below:</p>
    <p>
        <strong>FDR in favor of:</strong> {{data.fdrInFavourOf}}<br>
        <strong>FDR Amount:</strong> Rs. {{data.amount}}<br>
        <strong>FDR Expiry Date:</strong> {{data.fdrExpiryDate}}
    </p>

    <p>This FDR is required within {{data.timeLimit}} Hrs.{{#if data.isBgPurpose}} (12 hours in case of FDR for BG){{/if}}</p>

    <p>
        Please review the BG format, if accepted, send a request to the bank using the
        <a href="{{data.stage1Link}}">Stage 1: Request to Bank</a>. If Corrections are required, reject the request
        and mention the corrections needed.
    </p>

    <p>
        Please courier the FDR to the address below keeping sufficient margin for the courier delivery time to
        ensure the FDR reaches before the <strong>{{data.dueDateTime}}</strong> and share the SOFT COPY of the FDR
        and the Docket slip with us on time using the form
        <a href="{{data.stage2Link}}">Stage 2: After FDR Creation</a> or your dashboard:
    </p>

    <p>
        <strong>Courier Address:</strong><br>
        {{data.courierAddress}}
    </p>

    <p>Please attach the cover letter with the FDR when you courier the FDR. (Attached below)</p>

    <p style="font-style: italic;">"Ensuring timely operations is the only source of growth."</p>

    <p>
        Regards,<br>
        {{data.senderName}},<br>
        Approved by {{data.tlName}}
    </p>
</div>
